   "stem_html": "In plants, violet flower color (V) is dominant over white (v). If <span data-math=\"p = 0.8\">p = 0.8</span> and <span data-math=\"q = 0.2\">q = 0.2</span> in a population of <span data-math=\"500\">500</span> plants, how many individuals would you expect to be homozygous dominant (VV), heterozygous (Vv), and homozygous recessive (vv)? How many plants would you expect to have violet flowers, and how many would have white flowers?",
